# FounderVoice AI

Local-first coach for founders/executives. Differentiator: **Voice Memory** (longitudinal patterns), not one-off scores.

## Mandate

Every finding must answer: **what** → **why/cause** → **how to fix** (plus exercise when possible). Cite the user's history when Voice Memory has data.

## Non-negotiables

- Audio + Whisper stay local; coaching uses DeepSeek API (text only)
- Evidence-linked: findings map to audio timestamps
- Honest estimates: label emotion/investor/breath scores as estimates

## Stack

Next.js + Tailwind + Framer Motion + Recharts | FastAPI | Whisper (faster-whisper) | DeepSeek API | librosa + webrtcvad + ffmpeg | SQLite

## Agent behavior

1. If phase is unspecified, ask which phase (0–5) to build.
2. Ship vertical slices, not orphan metrics.
3. New finding types need: timestamp, severity, cause template, fix template.
